msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Breyta uppbyggingu valmyndarinnar sem JSON. Hvert atriði getur haft: name, "
"icon, command (keyrt í gegnum skel) eða action (setuaðgerð: lock, logout, "
"leave, switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (fylki "
"atriða) eða separator (true)."

